---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SlushTec — You act. The world keeps score."
  description="Indie game studio building adult interactive worlds with permanent consequences. Home of VARP (Virtual Action Role Play) and Ashcourt — Hell Rises."
>
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-16 pb-20">
    <p class="text-warm-earth text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase mb-5">
      Indie Game Studio · Tucson, Arizona
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
      You act.<br />
      <span class="text-golden-glow">The world keeps score.</span>
    </h1>
    <div class="score-line mt-6 mb-8 max-w-md"></div>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      SlushTec builds adult interactive worlds with permanent residual.
      Free-form action. Bidirectional relationships that can rise or collapse.
      A living street that remembers what you did.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a
        href="/projects"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-2.5 rounded bg-warm-earth text-iron font-medium hover:bg-golden-glow transition"
      >
        View Projects
      </a>
      <a
        href="/about"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-2.5 rounded border border-surface text-gray-200 hover:border-warm-earth hover:text-warm-earth transition"
      >
        About the Studio
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-surface bg-surface/40">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-golden-glow mb-8 tracking-tight">What we build</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <a href="/projects#varp" class="block p-6 rounded-lg badge-border group">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-white group-hover:text-warm-earth transition">VARP</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Virtual Action Role Play — a Virtual LARP engine with permanent memory,
            modular original World Packs, and bidirectional relationships that keep score.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a href="/projects#ashcourt" class="block p-6 rounded-lg badge-border group">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-white group-hover:text-warm-earth transition">Ashcourt</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Hell Rises — original-IP dark fantasy narrative aRPG.
            Also the flagship World Pack for VARP.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-golden-glow mb-6 tracking-tight">Design pillars</h2>
    <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-gray-300">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium">01</span> Permanent score — fail forward, no paid undo</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium">02</span> Bidirectional relationships that can collapse</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium">03</span> World-pack authenticity over generic helpfulness</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium">04</span> Local-first residual ownership</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium">05</span> Worlds, not agendas</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium">06</span> Minors: hard no</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
